Error [E0351]: the value tree is named `DataTree`, not `Data`
  --> tests/ui/data_renamed_to_datatree.jet:2:12
    |
  2 |     value: Data :: Data.Text("old")
    |            ^^^^
 Why: `DataTree` is the one name a hand codec constructs and returns and every format's `parse` yields — its variants are `.Null`/`.Bool`/`.Int`/`.Float`/`.Text`/`.Array`/`.Object`
 Fix: write `DataTree` instead of `Data`

